ā鍨嬪嚟鎹€丯ode.js 鎴栭澶?Python 鍖咃紝鍙洿鎺ヤ娇鐢?Python 杩愯鐪嬫澘銆?\r\n## 4. 鎵归噺杩愯涓庢棩蹇?\r\n```powershell\r\n# 浣跨敤榛樿 input 鐩綍\r\nuv run run_all.py --output output/demo\r\n\r\n# 鎸囧畾闇€姹傝緭鍏ョ洰褰?uv run run_all.py --input input --output output/demo\r\n```\r\n\r\n`--output` 涓哄繀濉弬鏁般€傝緭鍏ョ洰褰曞繀椤诲瓨鍦紝杈撳嚭鐩綍涓嶈兘绛変簬杈撳叆鐩綍锛屼篃涓嶈兘浣嶄簬杈撳叆鐩綍鍐呴儴銆俙run_all.py` 涓嶆彁渚涘崟闃舵鑴氭湰鐨?`--pause`銆乣--max-turns` 绛夊弬鏁伴€忎紶銆?\r\n杈撳嚭涓殑涓昏瑙傛祴鏂囦欢锛?\r\n```text\r\noutput/demo/\r\n鈹溾攢鈹€ run.log                 # 娴佹按绾夸簨浠朵笌姹囨€伙紝JSONL\r\n鈹溾攢鈹€ compiler.log            # 鍚勯樁娈电粓绔緭鍑?鈹溾攢鈹€ model_calls.jsonl       # 瀹屾暣妯″瀷璇锋眰銆佸搷搴斿拰璋冪敤鑰楁椂\r\n鈹斺攢鈹€ .arc/\r\n    鈹溾攢鈹€ backend_tdd.json    # 鍚庣娴嬭瘯鍙婂疄鐜版姤鍛?    鈹溾攢鈹€ ui_checks.json      # 椤甸潰瀛樺湪鎬ф鏌ユ姤鍛?    鈹斺攢鈹€ frontend_e2e.json   # 鍓嶇浜や簰涓?E2E 鎶ュ憡\r\n```\r\n\r\n闃舵鎶ュ憡鍦ㄧ浉搴旈樁娈垫墽琛屽悗浜х敓銆傚崟鐙繍琛岄樁娈佃剼鏈笉浼氶€氳繃 `run_all.py` 鐢熸垚娴佹按绾跨骇 `run.log`銆?\r\n### 4.1 `run.log` 鏍煎紡\r\n\r\n鏂囦欢閲囩敤 UTF-8 JSONL锛屾瘡琛屼竴涓?JSON 瀵硅薄锛岃拷鍔犲啓鍏ヤ笖閫愭潯鍒锋柊銆傚悓涓€杈撳嚭鐩綍澶氭杩愯浼氫繚鐣欏巻鍙茶褰曪紱姣忔杩愯閫氳繃 `run_id` 鍖哄垎銆傛墍鏈変簨浠跺甫鏈?UTC ISO 鏃堕棿鎴炽€?\r\n| 浜嬩欢 | 璁板綍鍐呭 |\r\n| --- | --- |\r\n| `run_start` | 杈撳叆銆佽緭鍑虹洰褰曚笌璁″垝闃舵鏁?|\r\n| `stage_start` | 褰撳墠闃舵鑴氭湰鍚嶇О |\r\n| `stage_end` | 闃舵鐘舵€併€侀€€鍑虹爜銆佽€楁椂鍙婂彲鐢ㄧ殑闃舵鎶ュ憡鎽樿 |\r\n| `run_end` | 鏁翠綋鐘舵€併€佹€昏€楁椂銆佸凡瀹屾垚闃舵鏁般€佸畬鎴愮巼銆佹ā鍨嬭皟鐢ㄤ笌 token 姹囨€?|\r\n\r\n鐘舵€佷娇鐢?`SUCCESS`銆乣FAILED`銆乣INTERRUPTED`銆傞樁娈靛け璐ュ悗鍋滄鍚庣画闃舵锛涙甯稿彲鎹曡幏鐨勫け璐ュ拰 Ctrl+C 涓柇鍧囦細灏濊瘯鍐欏叆缁撴潫浜嬩欢銆傚己鍒剁粓姝㈣繘绋嬫垨鏃ュ織瀛樺偍澶辫触鏃讹紝缁撴潫浜嬩欢鍙兘缂哄け銆?\r\n### 4.2 鎸囨爣鍙ｅ緞\r\n\r\n| 鎸囨爣 | 璁＄畻涓庡惈涔?|\r\n| --- | --- |\r\n| `stage_completion_rate` | 鎴愬姛瀹屾垚闃舵鏁?/ 璁″垝闃舵鏁帮紱涓嶆槸娴嬭瘯鎴栦笟鍔′换鍔￠€氳繃鐜?|\r\n| `elapsed_seconds` | 杩愯鎴栭樁娈电殑澧欓挓鑰楁椂锛屽寘鍚叾鍐呴儴缂栬瘧銆佹祴璇曞拰妯″瀷绛夊緟绛夊伐浣?|\r\n| `model.calls` / `errors` | 鏈鏂板 SDK `response`銆乣error` 浜嬩欢鏁?/ 鍏朵腑閿欒浜嬩欢鏁帮紱涓嶆槸 HTTP 灏濊瘯娆℃暟 |\r\n| `model.elapsed_seconds` | SDK 璋冪敤鑰楁椂涔嬪拰锛屽彲鑳藉寘鍚?SDK 鍐呴儴閲嶈瘯绛夊緟锛涗笉鍖呭惈璋冪敤澶栫殑缂栬瘧鍜屾祴璇曟椂闂?|\r\n| `prompt_tokens` / `completion_tokens` / `total_tokens` | 渚涘簲鍟嗚繑鍥炴湁鏁?`usage` 鐨勮皟鐢ㄧ敤閲忎箣鍜?|\r\n| `usage_calls` | 鏈夊畬鏁磋緭鍏ャ€佽緭鍑恒€佹€?token 瀛楁鐨勮皟鐢ㄦ暟 |\r\n| `token_usage_complete` | 璁板綍鐨勮皟鐢ㄦ槸鍚﹀叏閮ㄥ叿鏈夊彲鐢?token 鐢ㄩ噺 |\r\n| `recorded_generated_tasks` | 鎶ュ憡涓?`turns > 0` 鐨勫凡鎴愬姛璁板綍鍗?agent 浠诲姟鏁?|\r\n| `reused_tasks` | `turns == 0` 鐨勪换鍔℃暟锛岃〃绀哄凡鏈夊疄鐜扮洿鎺ラ€氳繃妫€鏌?|\r\n| `first_round_success_rate` | 涓婅堪鐢熸垚浠诲姟涓?`turns == 1` 鐨勬瘮渚?|\r\n| `mean_repair_rounds` | 涓婅堪鐢熸垚浠诲姟鐨?`turns - 1` 骞冲潎鍊?|\r\n\r\n鍚庣娴嬭瘯鐢熸垚涓庡疄鐜板垎鍒綔涓?agent 浠诲姟璁℃暟锛沀I 鎸夐〉闈换鍔¤鏁般€傚け璐ヤ换鍔＄殑杞暟娌℃湁瀹屾暣璁板綍锛屽洜姝ら杞垚鍔熺巼鍜屽钩鍧囦慨澶嶈疆鏁颁粎鎻忚堪鎴愬姛璁板綍鐨勪换鍔★紝涓嶄唬琛ㄥ畬鏁?benchmark銆傛病鏈夊悎鏍兼牱鏈椂锛岃繖涓や釜鎸囨爣涓?`null`銆?\r\n鍓嶇浜や簰鎶ュ憡涓殑 `test_turns`銆乣implementation_turns` 鎸夐渶姹備繚鐣欏湪 `interaction_rounds`锛涘叾涓疄鐜拌疆鏁板彲鑳界疮鍔犲涓?agent 璋冪敤锛屼笉鑳界洿鎺ュ噺涓€褰撲綔淇杞暟銆?\r\n娴嬭瘯鎽樿娌跨敤闃舵鎶ュ憡銆傛渶缁?GREEN 琛ㄧず褰撳墠楠屾敹妫€鏌ラ€氳繃锛屼笉绛変簬鐙珛璇勬祴闆嗕笂鐨勪换鍔℃垚鍔熺巼銆傛姤鍛婃枃浠朵笉瀛樺湪鎴栧唴瀹逛笌鎵ц鍓嶇浉鍚屾椂锛屼笉閲囩撼鍏朵綔涓烘湰娆℃柊鎶ュ憡銆?\r\nToken 姹囨€讳粠鍚姩鍓嶇殑妯″瀷鏃ュ織瀛楄妭鍋忕Щ璇诲彇锛屽彧缁熻 SDK 浜嬩欢锛岄伩鍏嶉噸澶嶈鍏?HTTP 鏃ュ織銆傜己灏戠敤閲忎笉浠ｈ〃闆舵秷鑰楋紝闇€缁撳悎瑕嗙洊鐜囪В璇汇€備笉鍚岃繍琛屽簲浣跨敤涓嶅悓杈撳嚭鐩綍锛岄伩鍏嶅苟鍙戝啓鍏ュ悓涓€ `model_calls.jsonl` 娣峰叆鏁版嵁銆?\r\n## 5. TUI 鐪嬫澘浣跨敤鏂规硶\r\n\r\n### 5.1 浜や簰妯″紡\r\n\r\n```powershell\r\nuv run view_run_log.py output/demo/run.log\r\n\r\n# 涔熷彲浠ヤ紶鍏ュ寘鍚?run.log 鐨勭洰褰?python view_run_log.py output/demo\r\n```\r\n\r\n榛樿閫夋嫨鏃ュ織涓渶鍚庡嚭鐜扮殑鏂拌繍琛岋紝鏄剧ず杩愯 ID銆佺姸鎬併€侀樁娈靛畬鎴愭儏鍐点€佹€昏€楁椂銆佹ā鍨嬬敤閲忓強鍏惰鐩栫巼锛屼互鍙婂悇闃舵鑰楁椂鏉″舰鍥俱€佹祴璇曟憳瑕佸拰杞暟缁熻銆?\r\n浜や簰鍛戒护杈撳叆鍚庨渶瑕佹寜鍥炶溅锛?\r\n| 鍛戒护 | 鍔熻兘 |\r\n| --- | --- |\r\n| `p` / `n` | 涓婁竴娆?/ 涓嬩竴娆¤繍琛?|\r\n| `j` / `k` | 鍚戜笅 / 鍚戜笂缈婚〉 |\r\n| `r` | 閲嶆柊璇诲彇鏃ュ織骞跺埛鏂板綋鍓嶈繍琛?|\r\n| `l` | 鍒囨崲鍒版渶鏂拌繍琛?|\r\n| `q` | 閫€鍑?|\r\n\r\n鐪嬫澘鎸夊懡浠ゆ墜鍔ㄥ埛鏂帮紝涓嶄細瀹氭椂鑷姩鏇存柊銆傚彲浠ュ湪鍙︿竴涓粓绔繍琛屾祦姘寸嚎锛屽悓鏃舵墦寮€鐪嬫澘瑙傚療锛涙ā鍨嬫眹鎬诲湪娴佹按绾垮啓鍏?`run_end` 鍚庢墠鍙敤銆?\r\n### 5.2 鍗曟杈撳嚭涓庨噸瀹氬悜\r\n\r\n```powershell\r\npython view_run_log.py output/demo/run.log --once\r\n\r\n# 淇濆瓨鏈€鏂拌繍琛岀殑鏂囨湰姒傝\r\npython view_run_log.py output/demo --once > run-summary.txt\r\n```\r\n\r\n`--once` 杈撳嚭鏈€鏂拌繍琛岀殑瀹屾暣姒傝鍚庨€€鍑恒€備笉鍦ㄤ氦浜掔粓绔腑杩愯鏃讹紝涔熻嚜鍔ㄩ噰鐢ㄥ崟娆¤緭鍑烘ā寮忋€?\r\n### 5.3 鏄剧ず绾﹀畾\r\n\r\n- `N/A` 琛ㄧず缂哄皯璁板綍锛屽尯鍒簬鐪熷疄鐨勬暟鍊奸浂銆?- `OPEN` 琛ㄧず灏氭湭璇诲埌缁撴潫浜嬩欢锛屽彲鑳戒粛鍦ㄨ繍琛岋紝涔熷彲鑳借寮哄埗缁堟銆?- 鑰楁椂鏉″舰鍥炬寜褰撳墠杩愯涓凡缁撴潫闃舵鐨勬渶澶ц€楁椂缂╂斁銆?- 鏃堕棿鎴虫寜鏌ョ湅绋嬪簭鎵€鍦ㄧ郴缁熺殑鏈湴鏃跺尯鏄剧ず銆?- 鏃犳晥 JSON 鍜岀己灏戞湁鏁堣繍琛?ID 鐨勮褰曡璺宠繃骞惰鏁帮紝鍖呮嫭鍐欏叆涓殑涓嶅畬鏁存湯琛岋紱鍒锋柊鍚庝細閲嶆柊璇诲彇銆?- 鏂囦欢涓嶅瓨鍦ㄦ垨娌℃湁鍙睍绀鸿繍琛屾椂锛岀▼搴忚緭鍑洪敊璇苟浠ラ潪闆剁姸鎬侀€€鍑恒€?\r\n## 6. 楠岃瘉鏂规硶\r\n\r\n鏃犻渶鐪熷疄璋冪敤妯″瀷锛屽彲鎵ц鏂板娴嬭瘯涓庡師鏈夋壒閲忚繍琛屽櫒鍥炲綊娴嬭瘯锛?\r\n```powershell\r\nuv run python -m unittest discover -s tests -p test_run_observations.py\r\nuv run python -m unittest discover -s tests -p test_view_run_log.py\r\nuv run python -m unittest discover -s tests -p test_portability.py -k PortableBatchRunner\r\n```\r\n\r\n杩欎簺娴嬭瘯楠岃瘉鏃ュ織缁熻銆佸け璐ュ拰涓柇澶勭悊鍙婄湅鏉胯В鏋愩€佽緭鍑鸿涓猴紝涓嶄唬琛ㄥ凡杩愯瀹屾暣妯″瀷鐢熸垚娴佹按绾匡紝涔熶笉楠岃瘉鐢熸垚搴旂敤鐨勪笟鍔℃纭€с€?\r\n## 7. Git 蹇界暐瑙勫垯\r\n\r\n`.gitignore` 蹇界暐鏈湴铏氭嫙鐜銆丳ython 缂撳瓨銆乣.env` 鍙婂叾鏈湴鍙樹綋銆佺敓鎴愬簲鐢ㄧ洰褰曘€丯ode 渚濊禆銆佹瀯寤轰笌娴嬭瘯浜х墿銆乣*.log` 鍜?`model_calls.jsonl`銆備繚鐣欏凡鏈?`slides/`銆乣docs/` 鎺掗櫎瑙勫垯銆?\r\n`.env.example` 鏄庣‘淇濈暀锛沗uv.lock`銆侀」鐩ā鏉裤€佽緭鍏ユ牱渚嬨€佹祴璇曚唬鐮佸拰鏈鏄庢枃浠朵笉鍦ㄦ柊澧炲拷鐣ヨ寖鍥村唴銆傝嚜瀹氫箟杈撳嚭鐩綍鑻ヤ笉浣嶄簬 `output/` 鎴?`outputs/` 涓嬶紝鍏剁敓鎴愭簮鐮佷粛鍙兘琚?Git 璺熻釜锛岄渶瑕佹寜瀹為檯鐩綍琛ュ厖瑙勫垯銆傚拷鐣ヨ鍒欎笉浼氳嚜鍔ㄥ彇娑堝凡璺熻釜鏂囦欢鐨勮窡韪姸鎬併€?\r\n[project]\r\nname = \"requirement-compilation-structure\"\r\nversion = \"0.1.0\"\r\ndescription = \"Compile a requirement tree into a database, backend APIs, and an interactive frontend\"\r\nreadme = \"README.md\"\r\nrequires-python = \">=3.11\"\r\ndependencies = [\r\n    \"PyYAML\",\r\n    \"openai\",\r\n    \"python-dotenv\",\r\n    \"jsonschema>=4,<5\",\r\n    \"httpx\",\r\n    \"playwright>=1.64.1\",\r\n]\r\n\r\n[tool.uv]\r\npackage = false\r\n\"\"\"Pipeline observations isolate runs and survive failure and interruption.\"\"\"\r\n\r\nimport json\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\nimport subprocess\r\nfrom tempfile import TemporaryDirectory\r\nimport unittest\r\nfrom unittest.mock import Mock, patch\r\n\r\nimport run_all\r\n\r\n\r\nclass RunObservations(unittest.TestCase):\r\n    def test_new_sdk_usage_only_and_round_summary(self):\r\n        with TemporaryDirectory() as temporary:\r\n            root = Path(temporary)\r\n            arc = root / \".arc\"\r\n            arc.mkdir()\r\n            model = root / \"model_calls.jsonl\"\r\n            old = json.dumps({\"event\": \"response\", \"response\": {\"usage\": {\r\n                \"prompt_tokens\": 999, \"completion_tokens\": 999, \"total_tokens\": 1998}}}) + \"\\n\"\r\n            model.write_text(old, encoding=\"utf-8\")\r\n\r\n            def wait():\r\n                usage = {\"prompt_tokens\": 10, \"completion_tokens\": 20, \"total_tokens\": 30}\r\n                with model.open(\"a\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as stream:\r\n                    for event in (\"http_response\", \"response\"):\r\n                        stream.write(json.dumps({\"event\": event, \"elapsed_seconds\": 2,\r\n                            \"response\": {\"usage\": usage}}) + \"\\n\")\r\n                (arc / \"backend_tdd.json\").write_text(json.dumps({\"status\": \"GREEN\",\r\n                    \"agents\": {\"a\": {\"turns\": 1}, \"b\": {\"turns\": 3}, \"c\": {\"turns\": 0}},\r\n                    \"summary\": {\"tests\": 4, \"pass\": 4, \"fail\": 0}}), encoding=\"utf-8\")\r\n                return 0\r\n\r\n            with patch.object(run_all, \"STEPS\", (\"08_implement_backend_tdd.py\",)), patch.object(\r\n                    run_all, \"start_process\", return_value=Mock(wait=wait)):\r\n                run_all.run_pipeline(root, root)\r\n            events = [json.loads(line) for line in (root / \"run.log\").read_text().splitlines()]\r\n            self.assertEqual(len({event[\"run_id\"] for event in events}), 1)\r\n            report = events[2][\"report\"]\r\n            self.assertEqual(report[\"first_round_success_rate\"], 0.5)\r\n            self.assertEqual(report[\"mean_repair_rounds\"], 1)\r\n            self.assertEqual(report[\"reused_tasks\"], 1)\r\n            self.assertEqual(events[-1][\"model\"][\"total_tokens\"], 30)\r\n            self.assertEqual(events[-1][\"model\"][\"calls\"], 1)\r\n            self.assertEqual(events[-1][\"status\"], \"SUCCESS\")\r\n\r\n    def test_failure_and_interrupt_are_recorded_with_distinct_runs(self):\r\n        with TemporaryDirectory() as temporary:\r\n            root = Path(temporary)\r\n            for outcome, exception in ((7, subprocess.CalledProcessError), (KeyboardInterrupt(), KeyboardInterrupt)):\r\n                child = Mock()\r\n                if isinstance(outcome, BaseException):\r\n                    child.wait.side_effect = outcome\r\n                else:\r\n                    child.wait.return_value = outcome\r\n                with patch.object(run_all, \"STEPS\", (\"first.py\", \"second.py\")), patch.object(\r\n                        run_all, \"start_process\", return_value=child) as start, patch.object(run_all, \"stop_process\"), self.assertRaises(exception):\r\n                    run_all.run_pipeline(root, root)\r\n                self.assertEqual(start.call_count, 1)\r\n            events = [json.loads(line) for line in (root / \"run.log\").read_text().splitlines()]\r\n            ends = [event for event in events if event[\"event\"] == \"run_end\"]\r\n            self.assertEqual([event[\"status\"] for event in ends], [\"FAILED\", \"INTERRUPTED\"])\r\n            self.assertNotEqual(ends[0][\"run_id\"], ends[1][\"run_id\"])\r\n            self.assertTrue(all(event[\"stage_completion_rate\"] == 0 for event in ends))\r\n\r\n\r\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\r\n    unittest.main()\r\n\"\"\"Dashboard tests use the actual run.log event shape, including partial runs.\"\"\"\r\n\r\nimport json\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\nimport subprocess\r\nimport sys\r\nfrom tempfile import TemporaryDirectory\r\nimport unittest\r\n\r\nfrom view_run_log import load_runs, render\r\n\r\n\r\nclass RunLogViewer(unittest.TestCase):\r\n    def test_interleaved_runs_partial_line_and_missing_usage(self):\r\n        with TemporaryDirectory() as temporary:\r\n            path = Path(temporary) / \"run.log\"\r\n            events = [\r\n                {\"run_id\": \"a\", \"event\": \"run_start\", \"planned_stages\": 2},\r\n                {\"run_id\": \"a\", \"event\": \"stage_start\", \"step\": \"08_backend.py\"},\r\n                {\"run_id\": \"b\", \"event\": \"run_start\"},\r\n                {\"run_id\": \"a\", \"event\": \"stage_end\", \"step\": \"08_backend.py\", \"status\": \"FAILED\",\r\n                    \"elapsed_seconds\": 12, \"report\": {\"summary\": {\"tests\": 3, \"pass\": 2, \"fail\": 1},\r\n                        \"recorded_generated_tasks\": 2, \"reused_tasks\": 1,\r\n                        \"first_round_success_rate\": 0.5, \"mean_repair_rounds\": 1.5}},\r\n                {\"run_id\": \"a\", \"event\": \"run_end\", \"status\": \"FAILED\", \"elapsed_seconds\": 15,\r\n                    \"model\": {\"calls\": 2, \"usage_calls\": 1, \"total_tokens\": 30, \"token_usage_complete\": False}},\r\n            ]\r\n            path.write_text(\"\\n\".join(json.dumps(event) for event in events) + '\\n{\"run_id\":', encoding=\"utf-8\")\r\n            runs, ignored = load_runs(path)\r\n            self.assertEqual([run[\"run_id\"] for run in runs], [\"a\", \"b\"])\r\n            self.assertEqual(ignored, 1)\r\n            text = \"\\n\".join(render(runs[0], 0, 2, ignored))\r\n            for expected in (\"FAILED\", \"12.0s\", \"pass=2/3 fail=1\", \"50.0%\", \"1.5\", \"partial / unavailable\"):\r\n                self.assertIn(expected, text)\r\n            partial = \"\\n\".join(render(runs[1], 1, 2, ignored))\r\n            self.assertIn(\"OPEN\", partial)\r\n            self.assertIn(\"total_tokens: N/A\", partial)\r\n\r\n    def test_plain_cli_accepts_output_directory_and_escapes_controls(self):\r\n        with TemporaryDirectory() as temporary:\r\n            path = Path(temporary) / \"run.log\"\r\n            path.write_text(json.dumps({\"run_id\": \"latest\", \"event\": \"run_start\", \"output\": \"bad\\u001b[2J\"}), encoding=\"utf-8\")\r\n            result = subprocess.run([sys.executable, str(Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1] / \"view_run_log.py\"),\r\n                temporary, \"--once\"], capture_output=True, text=True)\r\n            self.assertEqual(result.returncode, 0, result.stderr)\r\n            self.assertIn(\"RUN LOG DASHBOARD\", result.stdout)\r\n            self.assertIn(\"latest\", result.stdout)\r\n            self.assertNotIn(\"\\u001b\", result.stdout)\r\n\r\n\r\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\r\n    unittest.main()\r\nview_run_log.py:3:import argparse\nview_run_log.py:71:        f\"Output: {start.get('output', 'N/A')}\",\nview_run_log.py:78:    coverage = f\"{model.get('usage_calls', 'N/A')}/{model.get('calls', 'N/A')} calls\"\nview_run_log.py:81:        \"complete\" if model.get(\"token_usage_complete\") is True else \"partial / unavailable\"),\nview_run_log.py:100:    lines += [\"\", \"Round metrics: successful single-agent tasks only; excludes failed tasks and reuse.\",\nview_run_log.py:109:    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser(description=__doc__)\nview_run_log.py:110:    parser.add_argument(\"path\", type=Path, help=\"run.log path, or its output directory\")\nrun_all.py:3:import argparse\r\nrun_all.py:38:        \"usage_calls\": 0, \"prompt_tokens\": 0, \"completion_tokens\": 0, \"total_tokens\": 0}\r\nrun_all.py:53:            usage = event.get(\"response\", {}).get(\"usage\")\r\nrun_all.py:54:            if isinstance(usage, dict) and all(isinstance(usage.get(key), int)\r\nrun_all.py:56:                result[\"usage_calls\"] += 1\r\nrun_all.py:58:                    result[key] += usage[key]\r\nrun_all.py:59:    result[\"token_usage_complete\"] = result[\"calls\"] == result[\"usage_calls\"]\r\nrun_all.py:63:def stage_report(output: Path, step: str, before: bytes | None) -> dict | None:\r\nrun_all.py:64:    \"\"\"Summarize fresh reports; round metrics cover successful single-agent tasks only.\"\"\"\r\nrun_all.py:68:    path = output / \".arc\" / name\r\nrun_all.py:83:        \"round_metrics_scope\": \"Successful recorded single-agent tasks only; excludes failed tasks and aggregated frontend interaction rounds\",\r\nrun_all.py:87:def run_pipeline(input_dir: Path, output_dir: Path) -> None:\r\nrun_all.py:89:    output_dir.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\r\nrun_all.py:92:    model_log = output_dir / \"model_calls.jsonl\"\r\nrun_all.py:96:    with (output_dir / \"run.log\").open(\"a\", encoding=\"utf-8\", newline=\"\\n\") as log:\r\nrun_all.py:102:        record(\"run_start\", input=str(input_dir), output=str(output_dir), planned_stages=len(STEPS))\r\nrun_all.py:106:                command = [sys.executable, str(COMPILER_DIR / step), \"--input\", str(input_dir), \"--output\", str(output_dir)]\r\nrun_all.py:110:                report_path = output_dir / \".arc\" / name if name else None\r\nrun_all.py:132:                        report=stage_report(output_dir, step, before))\r\nrun_all.py:146:    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser(description=__doc__)\r\nrun_all.py:148:    parser.add_argument(\"--output\", type=Path, required=True, help=\"Shared output directory for all steps\")\r\nrun_all.py:151:        input_dir, output_dir = resolve_directories(args)\r\nrun_all.py:154:        show_panel(\"Requirement compiler | Pipeline\", f\"Input: {input_dir}\\nOutput: {output_dir}\\nStages to run: {len(STEPS)}\")\r\nrun_all.py:155:        run_pipeline(input_dir, output_dir)\r\nrun_all.py:162:    show_panel(\"[DONE] All steps completed\", f\"Output: {output_dir}\", tone=\"success\")\r\n.agent\r\n.git\r\n.venv\r\ninfrastructure\r\ninput\r\noutput\r\ntests\r\n__pycache__\r\n.env\r\n.env.example\r\n.gitattributes\r\n.gitignore\r\n00_project_initialization.py\r\n01_explore_requirement.py\r\n02_build_db_schema.py\r\n03_infer_db_obligations.py\r\n04_check_db_obligations.py\r\n05_implement_db.py\r\n06_decompose_backend_apis.py\r\n07_infer_api_contracts.py\r\n08_implement_backend_tdd.py\r\n09_design_ui.py\r\n10_implement_ui.py\r\n11_design_ui_interactions.py\r\n12_implement_frontend_tdd.py\r\npyproject.toml\r\nREADME.md\r\nrequirements.txt\r\nrun_all.bp\r\nrun_all.py\r\nuv.lock\r\nview_run_log.py\r\nwriteup.md\r\nf523e1f docs: enable continuous quota-aware scheduling for optimization\nf1209fd docs: define agent artifact layout before scheduler recovery\na8dbe5b docs: record scheduled agent optimization workflow\na64855a feat: baseline test and tui viewer submit\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Administrator\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps\\\\Microsoft.PowerShell_8wekyb3d8bbwe\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content run_all.py; rg --files input; rg -n 'turns|def run|raise|model_calls|max_retries' infrastructure/shared -g '*.py'; Get-Content tests/test_file_agent.py -TotalCount 100; Get-Content 01_explore_requirement.py -TotalCount 100; Get-ChildItem output -Name; Get-ChildItem -Recurse -Filter AGENTS.md -Name\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Administrator\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps\\\\Microsoft.PowerShell_8wekyb3d8bbwe\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content run_all.py; rg --files input; rg -n 'turns|def run|raise|model_calls|max_retries' infrastructure/shared -g '*.py'; Get-Content tests/test_file_agent.py -TotalCount 100; Get-Content 01_explore_requirement.py -TotalCount 100; Get-ChildItem output -Name; Get-ChildItem -Recurse -Filter AGENTS.md -Name\"","aggregated_output":"\"\"\"Run tutorial steps 00 through 12 sequentially without teaching pauses.\"\"\"\r\n\r\nimport argparse\r\nfrom datetime import datetime, timezone\r\nimport json\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\nimport subprocess\r\nimport sys\r\nfrom time import monotonic\r\nfrom uuid import uuid4\r\n\r\nfrom infrastructure.utils.cli import COMPILER_DIR, resolve_directories\r\nfrom infrastructure.utils.processes import start_process, stop_process\r\nfrom infrastructure.utils.presentation.logging import configure_console\r\nfrom infrastructure.utils.presentation.console import show_panel\r\nfrom infrastructure.utils.presentation.stages import stage_label\r\n\r\n\r\nSTEPS = (\r\n    \"00_project_initialization.py\",\r\n    \"01_explore_requirement.py\",\r\n    \"02_build_db_schema.py\",\r\n    \"03_infer_db_obligations.py\",\r\n    \"05_implement_db.py\",\r\n    \"06_decompose_backend_apis.py\",\r\n    \"07_infer_api_contracts.py\",\r\n    \"08_implement_backend_tdd.py\",\r\n    \"09_design_ui.py\",\r\n    \"10_implement_ui.py\",\r\n    \"11_design_ui_interactions.py\",\r\n    \"12_implement_frontend_tdd.py\",\r\n)\r\n\r\n\r\ndef model_observations(path: Path, offset: int) -> dict:\r\n    \"\"\"Count only new SDK events, never the duplicate HTTP response events.\"\"\"\r\n    result = {\"calls\": 0, \"errors\": 0, \"elapsed_seconds\": 0.0,\r\n        \"usage_calls\": 0, \"prompt_tokens\": 0, \"completion_tokens\": 0, \"total_tokens\": 0}\r\n    if not path.is_file():\r\n        return result\r\n    with path.open(\"rb\") as source:\r\n        source.seek(offset)\r\n        for line in source:\r\n            try:\r\n                event = json.loads(line)\r\n            except (ValueError, UnicodeDecodeError):\r\n                continue\r\n            if event.get(\"event\") not in {\"response\", \"error\"}:\r\n                continue\r\n            result[\"calls\"] += 1\r\n            result[\"errors\"] += event[\"event\"] == \"error\"\r\n            result[\"elapsed_seconds\"] += event.get(\"elapsed_seconds\", 0)\r\n            usage = event.get(\"response\", {}).get(\"usage\")\r\n            if isinstance(usage, dict) and all(isinstance(usage.get(key), int)\r\n                    for key in (\"prompt_tokens\", \"completion_tokens\", \"total_tokens\")):\r\n                result[\"usage_calls\"] += 1\r\n                for key in (\"prompt_tokens\", \"completion_tokens\", \"total_tokens\"):\r\n                    result[key] += usage[key]\r\n    result[\"token_usage_complete\"] = result[\"calls\"] == result[\"usage_calls\"]\r\n    return result\r\n\r\n\r\ndef stage_report(output: Path, step: str, before: bytes | None) -> dict | None:\r\n    \"\"\"Summarize fresh reports; round metrics cover successful single-agent tasks only.\"\"\"\r\n    name = {\"08\": \"backend_tdd.json\", \"10\": \"ui_checks.json\", \"12\": \"frontend_e2e.json\"}.get(step[:2])\r\n    if name is None:\r\n        return None\r\n    path = output / \".arc\" / name\r\n    if not path.is_file() or path.read_bytes() == before:\r\n        return None\r\n    try:\r\n        report = json.loads(path.read_bytes())\r\n    except (ValueError, UnicodeDecodeError):\r\n        return {\"report\": name, \"error\": \"Invalid report JSON\"}\r\n    records = report.get(\"agents\", {}) if step[:2] == \"08\" else report.get(\"pages\", {})\r\n    turns = [item[\"turns\"] for item in records.values()\r\n        if isinstance(item.get(\"turns\"), int) and item[\"turns\"] > 0]\r\n    return {\"report\": name, \"status\": report.get(\"status\"), \"summary\": report.get(\"summary\"),\r\n        \"recorded_generated_tasks\": len(turns),\r\n        \"reused_tasks\": sum(item.get(\"turns\") == 0 for item in records.values()),\r\n        \"first_round_success_rate\": sum(turn == 1 for turn in turns) / len(turns) if turns else None,\r\n        \"mean_repair_rounds\": sum(turn - 1 for turn in turns) / len(turns) if turns else None,\r\n        \"round_metrics_scope\": \"Successful recorded single-agent tasks only; excludes failed tasks and aggregated frontend interaction rounds\",\r\n        \"interaction_rounds\": report.get(\"requirements\") if step[:2] == \"12\" else None}\r\n\r\n\r\ndef run_pipeline(input_dir: Path, output_dir: Path) -> None:\r\n    \"\"\"Append flushed JSONL observations for successful, failed and interrupted runs.\"\"\"\r\n    output_dir.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\r\n    run_id = uuid4().hex\r\n    started = monotonic()\r\n    model_log = output_dir / \"model_calls.jsonl\"\r\n    offset = model_log.stat().st_size if model_log.is_file() else 0\r\n    completed = 0\r\n    status = \"FAILED\"\r\n    with (output_dir / \"run.log\").open(\"a\", encoding=\"utf-8\", newline=\"\\n\") as log:\r\n        def record(event, **data):\r\n            log.write(json.dumps({\"run_id\": run_id, \"timestamp\": datetime.now(timezone.utc).isoformat(),\r\n                \"event\": event, **data}, ensure_ascii=False) + \"\\n\")\r\n            log.flush()\r\n\r\n        record(\"run_start\", input=str(input_dir), output=str(output_dir), planned_stages=len(STEPS))\r\n        try:\r\n            for index, step in enumerate(STEPS, 1):\r\n                show_panel(f\"[{index}/{len(STEPS)}] {stage_label(step)}\", f\"Running {step}\")\r\n                command = [sys.executable, str(COMPILER_DIR / step), \"--input\", str(input_dir), \"--output\", str(output_dir)]\r\n                if step == \"01_explore_requirement.py\":\r\n                    command.append(\"--no-browse\")\r\n                name = {\"08\": \"backend_tdd.json\", \"10\": \"ui_checks.json\", \"12\": \"frontend_e2e.json\"}.get(step[:2])\r\n                report_path = output_dir / \".arc\" / name if name else None\r\n                before = report_path.read_bytes() if report_path and report_path.is_file() else None\r\n                stage_started = monotonic()\r\n                stage_status, code = \"FAILED\", None\r\n                record(\"stage_start\", step=step)\r\n                try:\r\n                    process = start_process(command, cwd=COMPILER_DIR)\r\n                    try:\r\n                        code = process.wait()\r\n                    except BaseException:\r\n                        stop_process(process)\r\n                        raise\r\n                    if code:\r\n                        raise subprocess.CalledProcessError(code, command)\r\n                    stage_status = \"SUCCESS\"\r\n                    completed += 1\r\n                except KeyboardInterrupt:\r\n                    stage_status = \"INTERRUPTED\"\r\n                    raise\r\n                finally:\r\n                    record(\"stage_end\", step=step, status=stage_status, returncode=code,\r\n                        elapsed_seconds=monotonic() - stage_started,\r\n                        report=stage_report(output_dir, step, before))\r\n            status = \"SUCCESS\"\r\n        except KeyboardInterrupt:\r\n            status = \"INTERRUPTED\"\r\n            raise\r\n        finally:\r\n            record(\"run_end\", status=status, elapsed_seconds=monotonic() - started,\r\n                completed_stages=completed, planned_stages=len(STEPS),\r\n                stage_completion_rate=completed / len(STEPS) if STEPS else None,\r\n                model=model_observations(model_log, offset))\r\n\r\n\r\ndef main() -> None:\r\n    configure_console()\r\n    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser(description=__doc__)\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"--input\", type=Path, default=COMPILER_DIR / \"input\", help=\"Requirement/image directory\")\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"--output\", type=Path, required=True, help=\"Shared output directory for all steps\")\r\n    args = parser.parse_args()\r\n    try:\r\n        input_dir, output_dir = resolve_directories(args)\r\n        if not input_dir.is_dir():\r\n            raise ValueError(f\"Input directory does not exist: {input_dir}\")\r\n        show_panel(\"Requirement compiler | Pipeline\", f\"Input: {input_dir}\\nOutput: {output_dir}\\nStages to run: {len(STEPS)}\")\r\n        run_pipeline(input_dir, output_dir)\r\n    except subprocess.CalledProcessError as error:\r\n        parser.exit(error.returncode if error.returncode > 0 else 1, f\"Pipeline stopped: {Path(error.cmd[1]).name} failed.\\n\")\r\n    except (OSError, ValueError) as error:\r\n        parser.exit(1, f\"Execution failed: {error}\\n\")\r\n    except KeyboardInterrupt:\r\n        parser.exit(130, \"Pipeline interrupted.\\n\")\r\n    show_panel(\"[DONE] All steps completed\", f\"Output: {output_dir}\", tone=\"success\")\r\n\r\n\r\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\r\n    main()\r\ninput\\tests\\REQ-2.spec.ts\ninput\\tests\\REQ-1.spec.ts\ninput\\tests\\helpers.ts\ninput\\requirements.yaml\ninput\\reference\\register.png\ninput\\reference\\login.png\ninput\\reference\\homepage.png\ninfrastructure/shared\\rag\\bm25.py:19:        raise ValueError(\"top_k must be positive\")\ninfrastructure/shared\\rag\\pages.py:10:    \"\"\"Page-first retrieval adapter that returns complete reusable UI/data subtrees.\"\"\"\ninfrastructure/shared\\rag\\schema.py:13:            raise ValueError(\"top_k must be positive\")\ninfrastructure/shared\\agent\\files.py:83:            raise ValueError(f\"Not a source file: {relative}\")\ninfrastructure/shared\\agent\\files.py:89:                raise ValueError(f\"Symlinks are not allowed: {relative}\")\ninfrastructure/shared\\agent\\file